# Track everything under .claude/ (skills, settings, agents, commands, hooks, etc.)
# so Claude's project memory and config persists across sessions and fresh clones.
# Exception: settings.local.json is per-machine personal overrides by convention.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/plans/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
build*.apk
*.apk
distro/
